<title>SPAIN: IBCA ups Spain's Banesto individual rating.</title>
<headline>IBCA ups Spain's Banesto individual rating.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Espanol de Credito (Banesto) said on Monday that London ratings agency IBCA had lifted its individual rating to C from C/D.</p>
<p>The statement added that other ratings were unchanged, with short-term at A1, long-term at A, and legal rating at 2.</p>
</text>
